      "cooked": "<p>I'm new to the weekly one shots even though I've owned the game since it came out I was waiting for multiplayer to come out and so kinda just forgot about it. Are the fights in weekly one shots scripted? Cause everything is pulling exacrlty the same so kinda feel more like card counting than actually strategy at this point since I know what cards I would need to defeat the villian and forcing the villian to mill me as close as possible to those cards seems kinda silly.</p>",
