      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/donner/{size}/1903_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-02-19T05:04:19.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Some are scripted (sort of), some are not.&nbsp; The random seed at the start has been set up for some of them to give specific cards.&nbsp; However, playing cards that mess with decks vs. not messing with decks will cause different cards to show up.&nbsp; Right now every game, when replayed, starts with the same random seed, so if you take the exact same actions you will get exactly the same outcome.</p>",
