      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/donner/{size}/1903_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-02-19T05:25:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Anything that shuffles a deck will allow that deck to get out different cards.&nbsp; Onboard Module Installation, or milling through a deck with Infrared Eyepiece or Trust Fund can change which cards get drawn and give you a chance even in a game where the starting seed isn't in your favor.</p>",
